#clubland #aatw #eurodance 

Cascada are a German Eurodance trio — vocalist Natalie Horler and producers DJ Manian and Yanou — who became one of the most successful dance acts of the 2000s, selling over 30 million records worldwide. Everytime We Touch hit #2 in the UK, #1 in Ireland and Sweden, and #10 on the US Billboard Hot 100, making Cascada one of the rare European dance acts to break the American mainstream. The track borrows its chorus from Scottish vocalist Maggie Reilly's 1992 song of the same name. In September 2025, Cascada and Steve Aoki released a new version to mark the track's 20th anniversary.

